{"id":"2f18fe544253d997","group":"27","path":"27/27-df-hornminorant.md","title":"Maximal Horn minorant by false-point closure","display":"df-hornminorant — Maximal Horn minorant by false-point closure","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-df-hornminorant","aliases":["27-df-hornminorant"],"display":"df-hornminorant — Maximal Horn minorant by false-point closure","depends_on":["[[27-df-meetclosure]]","[[27-df-truefalse]]"],"local_revision_status":"formal-audit-2026-10-20; source-not-rechecked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-df-hornminorant"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-df-hornminorant</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-hornminorant — Maximal Horn minorant by false-point closure"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ed790009f55244ee\" href=\"?note=ed790009f55244ee\" title=\"27-df-meetclosure\">27-df-meetclosure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"98e5c19fe4a2b9e2\" href=\"?note=98e5c19fe4a2b9e2\" title=\"27-df-truefalse\">27-df-truefalse</a></span></div>"},{"key":"local_revision_status","html":"formal-audit-2026-10-20; source-not-rechecked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\">\\([n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\)</span>; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n=\\mathbb B^{\\mathbb B^n}\">\\(\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n=\\mathbb B^{\\mathbb B^n}\\)</span>, as in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5d10aed668d85817\" href=\"?note=5d10aed668d85817\" title=\"27-df-boolfunc\">27-df-boolfunc</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F(f)\">\\(F(f)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MeetCl}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{MeetCl}_n\\)</span> 分别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"98e5c19fe4a2b9e2\" href=\"?note=98e5c19fe4a2b9e2\" title=\"27-df-truefalse\">27-df-truefalse</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"ed790009f55244ee\" href=\"?note=ed790009f55244ee\" title=\"27-df-meetclosure\">27-df-meetclosure</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\">\\(f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\)</span>。下式定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HornMinorant}_n(f)\">\\(\\mathrm{HornMinorant}_n(f)\\)</span> 的完整函数图，并声明 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HornMinorant}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{HornMinorant}_n\\)</span> 的定义域和值域。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HornMinorant}_n(f)\\coloneqq\\{(a,0)\\mid a\\in\\mathrm{MeetCl}_n(F(f))\\}\\cup\\{(a,1)\\mid a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\setminus\\mathrm{MeetCl}_n(F(f))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{HornMinorant}_n(f)\\coloneqq\\{(a,0)\\mid a\\in\\mathrm{MeetCl}_n(F(f))\\}\\cup\\{(a,1)\\mid a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\setminus\\mathrm{MeetCl}_n(F(f))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HornMinorant}_n:\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\to\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{HornMinorant}_n:\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\to\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Crama–Hammer (2011), §6.3, Theorem 6.7，印刷页 279，PDF 第 303 页（从 1 计数）。 两支以交闭包及其在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb B^n\">\\(\\mathbb B^n\\)</span> 中的补集为定义域，直接构成唯一全函数，不再借用仅以自然语言解释的示性函数；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F(h)=\\mathrm{MeetCl}_n(F(f))\">\\(F(h)=\\mathrm{MeetCl}_n(F(f))\\)</span>。最大性质在 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"1bbf751ce7a46128\" href=\"?note=1bbf751ce7a46128\" title=\"27-thm-hornminorant\">27-thm-hornminorant</a> 证明，不在定义中预先假定。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-meetclosure","status":"resolved","id":"ed790009f55244ee","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-meetclosure]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-truefalse","status":"resolved","id":"98e5c19fe4a2b9e2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-truefalse]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-boolfunc","status":"resolved","id":"5d10aed668d85817","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$, $[n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}$; $\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}$ and $\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n=\\mathbb B^{\\mathbb B^n}$, as in [[27-df-boolfunc]].","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-truefalse","status":"resolved","id":"98e5c19fe4a2b9e2","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$F(f)$ 与 $\\mathrm{MeetCl}_n$ 分别见 [[27-df-truefalse]]、[[27-df-meetclosure]]；$f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n$。下式定义 $\\mathrm{HornMinorant}_n(f)$ 的完整函数图，并声明 $\\mathrm{HornMinorant}_n$ 的定义域和值域。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-meetclosure","status":"resolved","id":"ed790009f55244ee","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$F(f)$ 与 $\\mathrm{MeetCl}_n$ 分别见 [[27-df-truefalse]]、[[27-df-meetclosure]]；$f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n$。下式定义 $\\mathrm{HornMinorant}_n(f)$ 的完整函数图，并声明 $\\mathrm{HornMinorant}_n$ 的定义域和值域。","embed":false},{"target":"27-thm-hornminorant","status":"resolved","id":"1bbf751ce7a46128","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"来源：Crama–Hammer (2011), §6.3, Theorem 6.7，印刷页 279，PDF 第 303 页（从 1 计数）。 两支以交闭包及其在 $\\mathbb B^n$ 中的补集为定义域，直接构成唯一全函数，不再借用仅以自然语言解释的示性函数；$F(h)=\\mathrm{MeetCl}_n(F(f))$。最大性质在 [[27-thm-hornminorant]] 证明，不在定义中预先假定。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"[n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n=\\mathbb B^{\\mathbb B^n}","display":false},{"tex":"F(f)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MeetCl}_n","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HornMinorant}_n(f)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HornMinorant}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HornMinorant}_n(f)\\coloneqq\\{(a,0)\\mid a\\in\\mathrm{MeetCl}_n(F(f))\\}\\cup\\{(a,1)\\mid a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\setminus\\mathrm{MeetCl}_n(F(f))\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HornMinorant}_n:\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\to\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathbb B^n","display":false},{"tex":"F(h)=\\mathrm{MeetCl}_n(F(f))","display":false}],"bytes":1463,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-233","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[27-df-hornminorant|df-hornminorant — Maximal Horn minorant by false-point closure]]"},{"id":"1bbf751ce7a46128","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{HornMinorant}_n$ and $\\mathrm{HornFunc}_n$ are defined in [[27-df-hornminorant]] and [[27-df-hornfunc]]."}],"outgoing":["ed790009f55244ee","98e5c19fe4a2b9e2","5d10aed668d85817","1bbf751ce7a46128"]}